# Nim's own `compiler/parser.nim`, which nifler parses `.nim` source with:
# `hastur build nifler` checks it out at the commit
# `src/nifler/nimparser/upstream.commit` pins (that file IS tracked), and
# `parser.fetched` records which commit the copy on disk came from.
src/nifler/nimparser/parser.nim
src/nifler/nimparser/parser.nim.tmp
src/nifler/nimparser/parser.fetched
